// BT-3117: metamorphic-testing probe for the BT-1226 bug class -- multi-
// statement `do:` block bodies with actor field mutations. The metamorphic
// harness's block-wrap ([expr] value) and redundant-temp
// (tmp := expr. tmp, block-wrapped) transforms route this file's call
// sites through an extra block/value indirection; this file gives that
// probe a real actor state-threading call site to run against (per
// BT-3117's acceptance criterion: hand-check that block-wrap over an actor
// field mutation exercises the BT-1226 shapes).

// @load test/fixtures/metamorphic_mutation_actor.bt

actor := MetamorphicMutationActor spawn
// => Actor(MetamorphicMutationActor, _)

actor addAll: #(1, 2, 3)
// => #{#seen => #(1, 2, 3), #total => 6}
